{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;<i>Hoist your sails and arm your cannons. The only thing more dangerous than the sea is the others you share it with.</i>&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 8 pirates battle it out either online or locally. Sink your rivals, gather gold, and dominate the oceans. The pirates with the most treasure at the end <strong>wins</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plunderdome</strong> is a <strong>top-down</strong>, <strong>multiplayer</strong>, <strong>couch-party game</strong> that blends <strong>arcade-style naval combat</strong> with a <strong>unique drafting system</strong>. Form a strategy as you pick your ships parts, before battling across open seas and archipelagos. Play <strong>free for all or with a team</strong> across a variety of game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2-8 players local or online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 500 different combinations to draft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture the Flag, King of the Hill, FFA, Team Deathmatch, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as teams, or free for all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original sound track</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3463830?t=1740169051","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3463830?t=1740169051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463830/a38b1619c5fe3e5f0f4b9065afecea9d75aee6f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740169051","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463830/a38b1619c5fe3e5f0f4b9065afecea9d75aee6f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740169051","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"descriptio